OL,3,GNEWSAHeadline acts announced for Y Not
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FDJ Fatboy Slim, Nile Rodgers & CHIC,
OL,7,FBlossoms and The Kooks have been
OL,8,Fannounced as the headline acts for next
OL,9,Fyear's Y Not festival in Derbyshire.
OL,11,FThe event returns to Pikehall, near
OL,12,FMatlock, from 29 July to 1 August.
OL,14,FOther acts announced include Tinie
OL,15,FTempah, La Roux, Groove Armada,
OL,16,FRazorlight, Feeder, Bastille and
OL,17,FSugababes.
OL,19,FThe four-day festival will mark its
OL,20,F20th event after first being held in
OL,21,F2005.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
